{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_04",
  "title": "無人的小巷",
  "storyCode": "DV-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5f4cbaf08105c4938ba9b559acc4275d4474f80493f3ea3314a16eb324dffad5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "text": "我們不認識你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "那我可要傷心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "麻煩給我來一杯“汐斯塔冰茶”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "——給這位先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "唔呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "text": "你怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "看來是酒吧裡的冷氣太足了，所以這位先生才哆嗦個不停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "那為何不再多喝一杯暖暖身體？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "哦，差點忘了，你口味變了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "以前還是主刀醫生的時候，你最喜歡的還是“汐斯塔冰茶”，因為夠烈，喝下去就能讓你忘掉洛肯·威廉姆斯的挑刺和辱駡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "現在他的刑期還剩一百二十二年，而你......你自由了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "自由......你跟我談論自由？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "我按你們說的，每周都會上傳身體數據......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "噓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "別提工作上的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "大家來酒吧，不都是為了放鬆一下嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "還是說，你寧可與這兩位......一個看不清表情一個沒有表情的人聊天，也不願意和你的老朋友喝一杯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "老朋友？呵......你開什麼玩笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "我變成這樣，不都是因為......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "text": "來吧，敬自由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "塞雷婭，他們讓我別無選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的男人",
      "text": "你只能靠自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人端起面前的酒杯，在眾人目光下喝下大半。\n他用力瞪著雙眼，什麼人都沒看，神情說不清是憤怒還是絕望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "很快，他就直挺挺地倒了下去。\n他的雙腿像突然受到電擊似的抖動著，左手卻死死地抓著自己的右臂。\n他的指尖幾乎要摳進自己的血肉裡，彷彿想把那團折磨他的電子元件連同過去的罪惡一起扯出身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
      "text": "天哪，這個人怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
      "text": "快打急救電話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "急病？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "酒裡有問題？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "......癲癇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "血液成分異常，是藥物誘發。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "我給他注射了急救藥劑，他的命能保住。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "那杯酒......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "還剩下半杯啊......我不喜歡浪費東西。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你喝掉了剩下的酒？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "如你所見。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "想不通的話，你可以檢查一下你朋友的牙齒。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "——左側第二小臼齒。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "一顆中空的假牙。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "在離開洛肯水箱之前，他做了最後一場手術，手術對象正是自己。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你早就知道這一點。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "我本該親手排除掉這個變數。畢竟，摘掉一顆牙齒並不會影響他的工作。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "但是我沒有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "我始終相信，在哥倫比亞，人們至少應該擁有擁抱死亡的自由。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "博士——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "請你扶著這位病人，站遠一些。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你是打算......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "我們眼前有一個問題不得不解決。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "text": "先生，新的測試資料出來了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "我希望這結果值得你在我面前大喊大叫。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "百分之六十七？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "text": "先生，我、我們已經盡力了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "重複實驗的結果呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "text": "也、也在這裡了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "把所有參數都拿過來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "text": "好......好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "text": "先生......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "老山羊居然真的沒有耍花招。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "text": "剩下就看霍爾海雅的了......她最好給我攔住塞雷婭。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "能被前萊茵防衛科主任稱作不得不解決的問題，我很榮幸。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你究竟是什麼人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "你沒見過我，塞雷婭主任。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "但我聽過你的許多事蹟。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "萊茵生命創始人之一，同樣畢業於特里蒙理工大學，取得生物醫學工程博士學位以後，卻幾乎在學界銷聲匿跡，轉而負責防衛科——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "提到萊茵生命，人人皆知克麗斯騰·萊特，卻很少有人聽說過你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "這麼多年來，你有過不甘心嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "沒這個必要。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "這是我自己的選擇，也是我的職責所在。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "我知道你沒有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "你把自己當成救火員，但你最享受的其實是衝進火場的感覺，不是嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "你喜歡戰鬥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "這並不意味著你是個戰士，塞雷婭。你沒有不斷挑戰和破壞的欲望。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "這讓你在科學界格格不入。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "五年前，繆爾賽思送給過你一株嫁接植物。挺好看的，對吧？她用了一點她最擅長的小花招，讓藤蔓學會了舞蹈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "你收下了禮物，但在那之後，每天早上七點，你都會在辦公室裡將那些生長得過於恣意的嫩芽修剪掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你一直在監控萊茵生命？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "也許我只是聽說了一點辦公室八卦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "那你一定沒聽說，那個夏天，繆爾賽思讓三位主任的辦公室變成了薩爾貢雨林。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "這給防衛科造成了不小的麻煩。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "那麼......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "對你來說，炎魔是多大的麻煩？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你說了這麼多廢話，至少有一點是對的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "我確實不討厭戰鬥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "好漂亮的源石技藝。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "當年你對你們總轄動手的時候，是不是也用的這招？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "作為一個雇傭兵，你好奇的事情未免太多了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "她們怎麼打、打起來了——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "是喝醉了鬧事嗎？怎麼沒有保安管管？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "你是保安嗎？你快點把她們趕走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "抱歉，我只是一名機械師。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "為了性命考慮，該走的是各位。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "酒吧客人",
          "text": "天哪！天花板快塌了，快、快走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "博士！你沒事吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我沒事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這位線人先生問題比較大。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mechanist，去幫塞雷婭。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "這麼急著結束戰鬥啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "你難道不想讓我多陪你一會嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "在哥倫比亞，能扛下你一擊的人不多吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "以你的身手，沒幾個人付得起這筆傭金。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "此事與沃爾沃特科欽斯基關係不大，你的戰鬥方式也並不是軍隊訓練出來的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你急於讓銀色試劑的線索中斷。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "那麼，你的雇主是斐爾迪南，還是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "......總轄？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "塞雷婭，哪怕到了這個地步，你第一個懷疑的對象也依然不是她嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你有太多問題。我必須把你留下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "塞雷婭！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "塞雷婭看清楚了自己同僚所在的位置。敵人的後路已被封鎖。\n並不需要更多交流，她不假思索地施放了源石技藝。\n琺瑯質的堅壁瞬間顯現，手刀直指霍爾海雅的要害。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "看來談話該結束了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你不躲？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "沒這個必要。我從來不做成功率太低的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "塞雷婭的五指本該觸碰到對面之人的腹部。\n奇怪的是，那並非人類血肉的觸感。\n霍爾海雅的臉上絲毫沒有疼痛的痕跡。\n她甚至湊得更近，嘴唇幾乎觸碰到了塞雷婭的耳廓。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "塞雷婭，不管你信不信，我真的只是想找你聊聊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "我對你很好奇......我對萊茵生命很好奇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "你的到來傷害了我的同伴。這種行為通常不能被稱作搭訕。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "呵呵......誰讓我也有必須完成的工作呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "最後送你一句話吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "不要急著與我為敵......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "不要急著與任何人為敵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "她跳了出去？這牆上......怎麼會有一個洞？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "是我幹的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "她的源石技藝誤導了你？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "不是源石技藝，是某項技術。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "她改變了附近一定區域內的空氣成分構成，干擾了我和我的源石技藝造物的聯繫，導致我的最後一擊偏離了方向。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "這項技術......我之前從未見過。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "繆爾賽思......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "text": "繆爾賽思的失蹤很有可能與她有關。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "她會不會也能切斷施術者和水分子的聯繫？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "text": "說不定。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "text": "我也想過，定向加熱空氣不是什麼高端的技術，不至於能控制住繆爾賽思。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "博士，我建議我們立刻追擊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "不論從她掌握的情報來看，還是從她使用的離奇技術來看——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "這位黎博利女士都極端危險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "警長，您這是要去哪裡？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "我不知道我還需要跟你報備。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "記錄顯示，您取走了一輛載具的鑰匙......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "哦，借用一下你們萊茵的資產。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "你樂意的話，幫我跟那個什麼混蛋主任報備下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "......警長。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "還有什麼話要說？麻煩快一點，我趕時間。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "瑪麗·班納女士，您從小就在特里蒙北郊的鐵馱鎮上生活。桑尼·羅馬諾是您的鄰居兼中學時的同窗好友。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "你調查我？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "四年前，羅馬諾被登記為感染者，結束了在律所的實習工作，返回鐵馱鎮。他的醫療保險費用在六個月後停繳。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "可是直到又過去三個月零十七天後，他的名字才出現在了這支拓荒隊的名單上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "中間這段時間，他究竟躲在哪裡？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "我怎麼知道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "預防問題發生也是我們防衛科工作的一部分。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "......小子，別以為你背一段資料就能嚇到我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "我花了五年時間才爬到這個位置上，你當我不知道怎麼跟你們這幫大公司養的蟲子打交道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "咳咳——女士，我從來沒有質疑過您的能力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "那就別逼我把你丟到荒地上餵牙獸。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "......警長，也許您不相信我，可我只是想提醒您。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "您......您偶爾會讓我想起我曾經的上司。我很尊敬她，但她被私人情感影響，親手毀掉了自己的前途。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "我不忍心看到您走上一樣的路。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "呵......私人情感？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "就算這玩意兒能救人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "text": "......也救不了自尋死路的那一個。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "緊急通訊——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
          "text": "聯繫斐爾迪南主任。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......第十七次記錄，座標，九區走廊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "對象位置距離上次記錄沒有發生變化......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "嗯......基礎粒子結構穩定。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "還是沒信號，什麼消息都發不出去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "（進度不能耽擱，得儘快修改方案......）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "（等通訊一恢復，得讓老闆收到這些報告。）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "......埃琳娜？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "咳......咳咳咳。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你在這裡幹什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我......我走兩步喘口氣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我明白你對拓荒者心有芥蒂......但我們最好還是待在一起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "上一次襲擊發生在十分鐘前，距離這裡很近。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "它們再次出現的話，你一個人會很危險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "好啊，我這就回去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "等等。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "在回去之前，你......你真的沒有什麼想對我說的話嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我不懂你在說什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "拓荒者們的情緒並不穩定。要是再次激怒他們，喬伊絲會有危險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "所以，我理解你並不想在他們面前說出真相。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "但這裡只有我和你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "你是想問實驗的事嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "你不是項目成員，除非你向公司提出申請......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "別再用這樣的說辭搪塞我了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我知道你跟我隱瞞了很多事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我並不生氣。我們是朋友，也是同事。萊茵生命的保密規定一向嚴格，規則之外，每個人也習慣於隱藏自己的真實想法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "奧利維亞，我不是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你不是故意的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我知道。我怎麼可能不知道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "公司裡的感染者並不多。那時候你剛來，午休的時候你主動跟我打招呼......能量科的同事拉住你，偷偷告訴你我是感染者。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你還是向我走了過來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我才不在意你身上那些石頭，誰還沒點毛病？說你閒話的人，他們就都完美無缺了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "就算後來......我也不在意我自己身上的石頭！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是啊，這才是我認識的埃琳娜·烏比卡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你很清楚，這裡的實驗出現了問題。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "打從一開始，你就知道那些銀色物體是什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "它們在威脅我們......和外面所有無辜者的生命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "我認識的埃琳娜，絕對不會坐視這麼可怕的事情發生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是什麼讓你選擇閉口不言？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是不是斐爾迪南......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......奧利維亞，這是我的工作。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "就跟海倫，還有無數為萊茵生命工作的研究員一樣......我的夢想就在這裡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "你說過，你也曾經感激過帕爾維斯主任和萊茵生命。而我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "......斐爾迪南是我努力的目標。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "他許諾了你什麼？幫弗蘭克斯主任做完這個實驗，就讓你單獨帶項目？還是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "奧利維亞，你和姐姐一樣，還當我是眼巴巴等著糖果的小孩子嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "我知道你對斐爾迪南......對主任有很多誤解，你這幾年做的那些針對他的調查已經給他添了不少麻煩......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "算了，我用不著替他解釋。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "可是，他原本可以拒絕你和羅德島介入。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "他也想改變萊茵生命，改變哥倫比亞......而且我相信只要有機會，他真的能做到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你......這麼相信斐爾迪南？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你知不知道萊茵......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "誰在那裡......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "是不是那些東西又追上來了？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "是拓荒隊的人！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "別過來！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "原來......原來領隊說的都是對的，你、你們的確是把我們當成實驗用獸......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "你可能理解錯了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "你還想哄騙我們嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "我......我不會再相信了！你們對我們好，都是假的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "請冷靜一些，嗯......你叫邁爾對吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "邁爾先生，你不信任我們的話，桑尼就在旁邊，你讓他來解釋一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "我不想......我不想死在這裡......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "這該死的......該死的走廊！根本走不到盡頭......就和感染者收治區的高牆一樣讓我喘不過氣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "放過我吧，讓我們離開......求你了，我求你了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "text": "要是你不答應，我、我就殺了她！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鴞",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "text": "喬伊絲！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "怎麼會......怎麼會這樣？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "text": "不，放開喬伊絲......不要傷害她！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "從地面痕跡來看，她剛走過了這裡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "能分辨她離去的方向嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "前面那條巷子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "繼續追。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等一下。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "還有幾個疑點沒有釐清。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "博士，你有什麼新發現？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "剛才那場戰鬥，我們贏了嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "我並不計較任意一場戰鬥的輸贏。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "......我明白博士的意思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "那個黎博利贏不了我們，但也不至於輸得那麼快。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "她至少還能再堅持個三分鐘左右。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "又或者，她可以在Mechanist趕來之前撤走。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她像是故意等Mechanist和我趕到。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她像是故意留下什麼資訊。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "text": "她想引我們進這條巷子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "text": "那我們還要進去嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "進。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "女士，我們都準備好了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "他們很快就會追上來吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "以塞雷婭的性格，就算猜到了我想引她來這裡，她也一定會來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "我還是有點擔心......那個，動力甲......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "真的不用經過斐爾迪南先生同意嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "這麼說，你想考慮一下我更早的提議？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "您是說把我......不不，我什麼都沒說。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "這是一場測試。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "我們的雇主會樂於見到結果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "女士，我聽到腳步聲了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "通知領航小隊，開始行動。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
          "text": "我們呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "text": "撤。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
